'   "AGENT\345\205\203\346\225\260\346\215\256\350\256\276\350\256\241.json":2-47.
' - Fields at lines 2-24 map to t_agent_definition; enabled is Boolean.
' - models at line 11 maps to the only ordered child table.
' - Tool binding and permission fields at lines 25-30 and 37-47 are merged.
' - Skill bindings at lines 31-36 have no order column.
' Observed behavior: the current JSON is a current-state Agent resource with a
' monotonically increasing version and no separate history resource.
' Design reason: fixed scalar and system prompt fields use typed columns,
' use_cases remains one JSON array, and independently queried references use tables.
' Product constraint: only model order is persisted; Tool and Skill order is not.
